@startuml
scale max 2800 width
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false

title Activity Diagram WF-05 - B2C Subscription Upgrade via PayOS & Daily Gamification Rewards

|Customer|
start
:Select Subscription Tier (Plus / Pro) & click Upgrade;

|Core Backend|
:Create PaymentOrder (status = PENDING, fulfillmentStatus = PENDING);
:Request payment link & VietQR from PayOS Gateway;

|Customer|
:Scan VietQR code & complete bank transfer;

|PayOS Gateway|
:Dispatch signed webhook to POST /api/v1/payments/payos/webhook;

|Core Backend|
:Verify HMAC-SHA256 webhook signature;
if (Signature valid & code == '00'?) then (Yes)
    :Record PaymentTransaction (status = SUCCESS);
    :Update PaymentOrder (status = PAID);
    :Lock order (fulfillmentStatus = PROCESSING);
    :Activate new UserTier & credit Tier tokens to User;
    :Mark PaymentOrder (fulfillmentStatus = FULFILLED);
else (Webhook delayed / transient error)
    :PaymentFulfillmentReconciliationScheduler retries\nunfulfilled PAID orders every 60 seconds;
endif

|Customer|
:Perform Daily Check-In & complete Daily Quests\n(CHAT, QUIZ, READ_CONTEXT);
:Claim quest reward tokens;
:System updates UserQuestProgress (claimed = true)\nand increments User token balance;
stop
@enduml
